      "notice": null,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "type": "warmup",
          "title": "Warm-up",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: what did vaṇḍi mean?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: பேருந்து",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "பேருந்து (pērundu) — \"a bus\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A made word, and you can take it apart. பேர்- is the big-word பெரு, and உந்து is \"to push along\". A big pushed thing."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "This is the printed and announced word: it is what stands on the board at the stop and in the newspaper. In the street you will also hear the English \"bus\" said plainly, and both are understood — but only one of them is written on the board you have to read."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Two, and one of them you can take apart."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 1,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 1s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "pērundu",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *pērundu*]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "the two pieces, then the whole word",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: the two pieces, then the whole word]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "RECALL",
              "instruction": "say pai, then say vaṇḍi, then say pērundu",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU RECALL: say *pai*, then say *vaṇḍi*, then say *pērundu*]"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "type": "recall",
          "title": "Wrap-up Recall",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 3,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "What are the two pieces inside பேருந்து (pērundu)? (\"Big\", and \"push along\".)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TA-W25-read-vandi",
      "sequence": 2750,
      "title": "வண்டி (vaṇḍi) — a dot joining two letters",
      "headword": "வண்டி",
      "romanization": "vaṇḍi",
      "gloss": "the word for a vehicle on the page — a puḷḷi between two consonants",
      "script": "tamil",
      "modality": "pen",
      "derivedModality": "pen",
      "modalityReasons": [
        "writing-type",
        "script-block",
        "sight-cue"
      ],
      "sourceHash": "fnv1a64:c565dd6a77e2d4f4",
      "notice": {
        "modality": "pen",
        "needs": [
          "a pen and something to write on",
          "your eyes, for letter shapes on the page",
          "your eyes, because the lesson points at something written down"
        ],
        "waitUntilStopped": [
          "Script you'll notice: வண்டி — a dot joining two letters",
          "Guided Practice"
        ],
        "text": "Before we start: this one needs your hands, so it is not a driving lesson. You will want a pen and something to write on, your eyes, for letter shapes on the page and your eyes, because the lesson points at something written down. You can listen to everything else now — leave the sections called Script you'll notice: வண்டி — a dot joining two letters and Guided Practice until you have stopped, and I will say so again when we reach it."
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "type": "warmup",
          "title": "Warm-up",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the page: you can say vaṇḍi and pērundu. Now look at the first one on the page."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "script",
          "title": "Script you'll notice: வண்டி — a dot joining two letters",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "வண்டி (vaṇḍi) brings no new shape either. What it brings is the புள்ளி doing its job between two different letters, where சட்டை showed it between two of the same one."
            },
            {
              "kind": "table",
              "headers": [
                "piece",
                "",
                ""
              ],
              "columns": 3,
              "rowCount": 3,
              "utterances": [
                "piece: வ, va, the letter with its built-in a.",
                "piece: ண், ண with a புள்ளி, closed — nothing said after it.",
                "piece: டி, ḍi, ட with the ி sign."
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "வ, ண், டி becomes வண்டி (vaṇḍi)."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Read the middle two as one movement rather than two beats. That is what the புள்ளி is asking for: ண் has no vowel of its own left, so it has nowhere to go except onto the letter after it."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 1,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 1s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "READ",
              "instruction": "வ — then ண் — then டி",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU READ: **வ** — then **ண்** — then **டி**]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "POINT",
              "instruction": "the புள்ளி, and say which letter it has emptied",
              "spoken": false,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU POINT: the புள்ளி, and say which letter it has emptied]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "READ",
              "instruction": "சட்டை, then வண்டி (vaṇḍi) — the same dot, two different jobs",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU READ: **சட்டை**, then **வண்டி** — the same dot, two different jobs]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "RECALL",
              "instruction": "say vaṇḍi, then say pērundu, then read வண்டி",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU RECALL: say *vaṇḍi*, then say *pērundu*, then read **வண்டி**]"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "recall",
          "title": "Wrap-up Recall",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 3,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Read வண்டி (vaṇḍi). What has the புள்ளி done to the ண? (Taken its vowel away, so it leans on the ட.)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
