        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: சாலை",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "சாலை (sālai) — \"a road\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A made road, wide enough for a வண்டி (vaṇḍi) to go down."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Set it beside பாதை (pātai), the path you already have. A பாதை is walked; a சாலை (sālai) is driven. The difference is not size so much as what it was made for."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Both end in the same ை, which by now you have read four times."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Four, and the vehicles have somewhere to run."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 1,
